This template sets the software_packageUrl value in SPDX 3.0 SBOM.

This template depends on the openembedded-core commit
c8e6953a0b6f59ffca994c440069db39e60b12d2.
That commit set a variable SPDX_PACKAGE_URL to enable the
software_packageUrl field in SPDX 3.0 SBOM.

This template fill the variable value for each installed package.
Developer can insert private information into the purl qualifiers
field through SPDX_PURL_QUALIFIERS_EXTEND variable.
Through SPDX_PURL_SUBPATH variable set the purl subpath field.

To use the template, add "--templates feature/purl" as a setup
option.

#@TYPE: Wrtemplate
#@NAME: purl
#@DESCRIPTION: Enable software_packageUrl field in SPDX 3.0 SBOM.

